      "value": "about F5 turning down brightness: Sounds like you need to Hold FN key and then press F5. (or enable FN Lock)\n\nAbout no longer being able to zoom out:\n\nThey moved the 3rd person feature to a beta version instead of keeping it in the main/stable version:\n\nGo to steam, go to vrchat on steam, open properties (under manage), go to Gameversions and betas, and then switch to 3p-beta version",
