  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello VRChat, I broke my 3rd person button by accident. I was trying to zoom out on my avatar one day, and the game wasn't fully loaded in. It did it, then put me back in first person, and I have not been able to zoom out since. If it helps, I am on PC and also can't use the F5 buttons because it just turns my brightness down. please help when you can.",
